     strengths:['First-party ML / data-science on the same governed platform','Open table formats reduce format lock-in','Unified catalog and lineage across BI and ML','ISO 27001 certified (credible public sources · not validated)','Incumbent-adjacent, lower integration friction','Broad SI partner ecosystem shortens delivery'],
