     lillyFit:{relation:'Net new',strategic:'neutral',pharma:'The third-party risk (TPRM) assessment is still open and certification depth is thin; a formal security screen would be required before any commitment (a risk signal).',value:'A genuine price / downshift lever; the next move is to keep it in the field for commercial tension rather than as the governance-grade default.'},
