     finHealth:'Illustrative financial read (external · credible public sources, not validated): a smaller, price-led growth-stage vendor at roughly $200M revenue, ~20–25% YoY, thinner margins on aggressive list pricing and moderate cash runway. Viability is adequate but a multi-year watch item given the smaller scale. Figures are owner-sanctioned mock; audited statements would be sourced in a live deep dive before commitment.',
     strengths:['Lowest list price in the field, strong commercial lever','Adequate core warehouse performance and scale','Simple, familiar SQL surface','Aggressive commercial flexibility on price and terms','Straightforward stand-up for core workloads'],
